  {
   "id": "sec3-1",
   "section": "Presidency",
   "text": "On 4 March 2026, media outlets reported that the PDK had proposed her as a potential candidate for the 2026 Kosovan presidential election.",
   "words": 23,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
