   "id": "sec3-4",
   "section": "Presidency",
   "text": "She was proposed by Prime Minister Albin Kurti after earlier candidates failed to win the backing of the opposition Democratic Party of Kosovo (PDK), ending a deadlock that had left the office vacant since Vjosa Osmani's term ended on 4 April 2026.",
